Review this change for security vulnerabilities.

Changed files (you may Read these and any other file in the repo):
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/AppStore.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/RemoteStateModel.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/StatusCommandRunner.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/UITestFixture.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/VCSModels.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/VCSWriting.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Views/ChangesPanel.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Views/VCSToolbar.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomAppTests/RemoteStateModelTests.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomAppTests/VCSRemoteTriggerTests.swift

Unified diff (only + lines are new):

